# Harmonic Prodigy's "Shaman" is a word of its text (CR 612): Artificial Evolution replacing Shaman with Elf in it makes its
# rule "an Elf or another Wizard", so Ignoble Hierarch, still a Goblin Shaman, is no longer one of them. The Prodigy
# attacks alone on turn 3 and the Hierarch's exalted triggers once: 2/4, 2 damage. (Unchanged, it triggers twice:
# harmonic-prodigy-doubles-ignoble-hierarchs-exalted.) The Evolution's prowess pump on turn 1 is over by turn 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Ignoble Hierarch
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Harmonic Prodigy
Mox Sapphire
Artificial Evolution
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

